00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:07.140
Rumi-san's going home? I thought of going shopping with her tomorrow, too.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.190
Somehow this feels lonely.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.860
It's just for a day, I'll be back tomorrow night anyway.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.310
Alright, be good and wait till then, ok?

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:16.950
Yeah. Be careful.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:34.290
I've heard of students commuting from home, nevertheless what an amazing car.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:41.340
recipe 8

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:41.340
Genius, Enemy and Airhead?

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:47.510
Hey!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.940
Why are you roaming around?

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:55.730
I wasn't roaming around. I was just sending off Rumi-san who went home.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:03:00.450
Eh, that means you'll be all alone in your room. Will you be all right?

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.450
What about it?

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.360
They'll show up... these things!!!

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.160
Don't say such strange things!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:23.890
It's unsettling being alone in the dorm room after all.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.940
They'll show up... these things!!!

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.160
Geez, 'these things' indeed.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.410
How stupid.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.760
It's best to place lots of it inside after all...

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.760
My, my, Vanilla.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:05.970
You accidentally overflow the sponge cake with cream and barely any chocolate... you bungling fool!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.880
Shut up, Devil Kashino!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:11.360
These things showed up...

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:21.410
I'm lacking sleep because of the nightmare.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:25.690
Me too, I'm lacking sleep from falling off the bed!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.410
You seem really free, Amano-san.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:33.700
We are going to the forest behind to pick walnuts. Won't you come?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.590
Picking walnuts?!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.590
Walnuts. Walnuts. What should I make with it?

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:43.630
Cookie? Pound cake? Or maybe...

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:49.080
Hey, hey, something is weird. For you to be invited by that B-group who usually makes fun of you.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.140
Isn't it better to be careful?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.180
Eh, you're thinking too much.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.490
I was just speaking to myself. Myself.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.880
On my, I found it.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:11.380
Eh?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.900
Where, where?!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.470
Ah! It's true!

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.650
Over there. Over here, too. Here as well.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:22.370
Amazing! Amazing! There are so many.
Look. Amazing! They are here too.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:26.570
This is great. Wow! Amazing! So much fun! Ah! This too. Wow! Amazing! Fantastic!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.840
Look! There are so many... huh?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.850
Oh, my, Amano-san...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.560
Really, how amusing.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.510
Where did everyone go? Over there, maybe?

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:49.760
No, they're not. Those people had planned to leave you behind from the start.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:55.080
But, we're still within the academy. We'll get back in no time.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.050
That's what I thought. But I can't get out of this forest.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:05.090
Hang on there, Ichigo.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.010
I'm hungry.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.590
I'll give you this.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.800
Are you sure?!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:28.300
It's not working. I'm just getting more hungry.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.190
Ichigo...

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.930
This piano...

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:39.440
Over here.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.000
This way.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.340
Wait, Ichigo!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.520
Escape, successful.

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.050
Are you alright?

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.480
Queen...

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:23.480
Sweets Spirits Queen!! Queen!!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:27.580
Amano-san. Amano-san. Amano-san.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:36.510
Queen...

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.010
Huh?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:42.970
Eh! Tennouji-san!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.120
Where am I?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.360
Don't worry. It's my room.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.310
I'm sorry.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:11.010
I'm sorry. I don't know why, but somehow, I'm intruding on you.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.700
I'll leave immediately.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:14.900
Ouch!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.610
Amano-san.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:24.740
Yes.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:28.020
You can rest here for a while, Amano-san.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:29.390
Say...

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:30.470
What's the matter?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.450
How did you know my name?

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.000
You called me by name earlier as well, right?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.690
Amano Ichigo-san.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:45.250
After you were scouted by Henri-sensei and transferred here, you became famous all over the school.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.990
I-Is that so?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:51.330
I was just making some soufflé, would you like some?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.380
Soufflé!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:11.250
Amazing. There are no wasted movements nor hesitation.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.260
This is indeed Tennouji-san.

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.010
Big difference compared to Ichigo!

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:25.020
Amano-san, between Darjeeling and Earl Grey tea, which do you...

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:34.730
School cake competition winner, Junior cake competition winner, top in entrance exams in the country.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.380
There are so many others as well!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.660
Amazing!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.220
All these are just ornaments.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:44.100
I work hard only for the acknowledgment of one person.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.850
Trophies are just a bonus.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:53.190
Even then, this is amazing. That person must be really pleased too, right?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.300
Yes...

00:09:58.680 --> 00:09:59.580
Extremely.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.550
But this is lovely. It's spacious, and there's a kitchen, too.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:08.420
To be living in such a classy room indeed.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.760
Wow, this looks delicious!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:24.970
Hey!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.280
No, nothing.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.520
Now, help yourself.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.080
Itadakimasu!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:44.000
Sweet! The natural sweetness of honey balanced perfectly was the first sensation,

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:50.070
but in an instant it just melts in your mouth.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:59.750
Eh? There seems to be fruits fragrance, but it tastes like mandarin orange.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.990
There aren't any fruits in it are there?

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:06.780
Yes. That might have been the taste of the honey.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.310
Honey?

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.440
I used mandarin orange honey for the soufflé.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:16.480
It doesn't have the richness of a Japanese confectionery but it has an unique refreshing flavor.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.900
As I thought, it's mandarin orange.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:22.920
Delicious!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.740
Amano Ichigo.

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.190
Thank you very much!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.940
How much ability is hidden behind that innocent smile of hers?

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.980
You were at president Tennouji's room?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.970
And it was a really amazing room.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.710
Are you having a fever, Ichigo-chan?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.890
What? Don't you believe me?

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.910
But we're talking about president Tennouji here.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.860
The genius girl who wins at every concour.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:13.250
Even professionals admire the sweets she makes.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:20.670
The soufflé Tennouji-san makes, is fluffy, blooms and just melts in your mouth. It was really delicious.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.240
Vanilla wanted some too.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.420
What's the matter Rumi-san?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:29.600
Did you really <i>eat</i> president Tennouji's soufflé?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.260
Yes.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.200
Rumi-san!?

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:38.020
Maybe president Tennouji is interested in you?

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:43.740
President is specially doted on by Henri-sensei. Right now, she's like his favourite pupil.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.040
I work hard only for the acknowledgment of one person.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:54.160
She must have been talking about Henri-sensei.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:13:00.420
And Ichigo-chan was scouted by Henri-sensei to be here. Of course she'll be wondering about it, won't she?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.530
No way. For someone as lousy as I am.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:06.980
Tennouji-san only saved me out of kindness, that's all.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.570
Really?

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:13.310
By the way, president Tennouji has entered for the cake Grand Prix this year.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.480
Cake Grand Prix is...

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:20.490
The greatest event at St. Marie. The winner gets to study in Paris.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.850
Ah, Paris!

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:27.080
President Tennouji actually submitted an entry, having never participated in it all this time.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:29.790
For the sake of going to Paris where Henri-sensei is?

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.080
That might just be it.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:36.160
Wow, that's nice. When I get to high school, I'd like to enter too.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.630
What are you saying? Middle schoolers can participate, too.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:43.670
No way. Middle schoolers level are too different from high schoolers, aren't they?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.160
It may seem impossible, but the likelihood still exist.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.570
Last year for example,

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:51.850
the Sweets Princes group were the only ones from middle school who made it to the second round.

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:57.350
For a middle schooler to even get past the preliminaries is record breaking.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.420
Kashino and the others really are amazing.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:04.240
In the first place, they would have gone even further if not Ojou had been in the group.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.230
Ojou?

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:06.980
She was our senpai previously but...

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:10.380
Ah! Don't ever mention her to Kashino.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.540
It's taboo! Taboo!

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:13.780
Yeah.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.420
But it's really amazing, Amano-san.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:24.750
Ichigo-chan must be the only middle schooler who has been invited into president Tennouji's room.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:28.590
Rather than being invited, I was saved, I think.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:34.640
Amano's a fool after all. Walnut season was long gone. Yet she entered the forest and got lost there.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:38.350
We must be volunteers to have such an idiot in our group.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:41.230
Is that so? How about just grouping with Ojou-san then?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.270
O-Ojou...

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.030
Well, just calm down.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:50.470
For Kashino to be this distracted indeed.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.070
That must have been quite traumatic.

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:56.170
What happened with Ojou-san?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.540
Don't do that!!!

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:06.670
What the heck. To have heard such an ominous name.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:13.320
Ojou-san is actually called Koshiro Miya-san. She's a third year middle schooler.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.890
She's the daughter of the president of the famed Château.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:22.900
The famed Château is the large industrial company famous for its chocolate and cookies, right?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.420
Somehow, she fell for Kashino.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:31.740
Last year at the Cake Grand Prix, we were strangely teamed up, but...

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:34.720
What is this?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:37.240
Oh no, I've accidentally added soy sauce.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.870
This is my best marzipan.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.340
It's too hard!!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:49.210
In the end, even though the three of us did our best but...

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:56.620
Très bien, darling.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:06.520
Ever since then, Kashino's hatred for women skyrocketed.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.730
I-I see...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.780
But with Ichigo-chan, we might be able to do it at the Cake Grand Prix.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.420
Eh? Me?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.300
Yes, that's how it feels like.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.190
Cake Grand Prix, huh?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.870
Before that, we have to do exorcism.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:26.920
Come with me!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.340
Exorcism?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:38.180
Wow! I can't make up my mind.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.350
There are newly created cakes too.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:44.280
No, the one that you must try at least once here is...

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.870
Angel's pudding.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.050
Ah, the one that was sold out the last time we came.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:52.190
It's the most popular sweets made by president Tennouji.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.390
Tennouji-san's?

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:57.230
I must eat it then. The soufflé yesterday was wonderfully delicious, too.

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.600
President Tennouji's soufflé?!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.540
Yes. Honey pudding.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.580
I see.

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:12.130
Why did only Amano got to eat persident Tennouji's soufflé? Why at that time?

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:14.300
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.110
Huh?

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.910
But we haven't made our order yet.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:19.270
Angel's pudding. Itadakimasu!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:31.030
What intense aura. A great use of eggs and milk, and the rich flavor of fresh cream.

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:33.030
It feels like the flavour the sun would have.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.020
That's true.

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.120
Delicious.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:39.970
Yes.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:43.400
This caramel sauce tastes great.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:44.340
Yes. Yes.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:48.090
Did you like my pudding, Makoto-kun?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.590
Koshiro Miya-san?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:57.760
Hello!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.080
This person is...

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:03.200
Satou! Shiotani! Bring Makoto-kun an extra large pudding.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:03.840
Yes.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.590
My skills have improved, right?

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:12.770
For Makoto-kun's sake, I've been intensively training under a first class pâtissier.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:17.420
This year we'll definitely win the Grand Prix and travel to Paris, darling.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:24.740
I'm sorry. senpai. But this year, umm...
we'll be grouping with Amano instead.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:26.000
What did you say?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:31.410
Ah, the girl that Henri Lucas scouted, huh?

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:35.040
I heard that you can't even make crêpes despite being in A-group.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.200
She can make them now!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.930
What was that?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.550
Just your imagination. Just your imagination.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:45.740
Amano-san. How about letting her try the cake we made on self practice earlier?

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.270
Sure.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.480
It's Mont Blanc though.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.840
Somehow, things have gotten interesting.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:57.990
That's right.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.820
What an impoverished flavour.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:10.080
Was she really scouted by Henri-sensei?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:15.370
The genius pâtissier, Henri Lucas has poor judgement of people, huh?

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:19.970
Hey, how about grouping with me instead of that?

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.830
I'll prepare the best ingredients.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.800
Don't say that.

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.480
What? Did you speak?

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.180
Don't speak badly of Sensei!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.350
Oh!

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:33.970
Huh? What's wrong with saying honestly that he has bad judgment of people?

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.990
I don't want you to make your decision based on that.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:40.300
I'll make a pudding much <i>more</i> delicious than this!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.690
Did you hear that, guys?

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.370
That's the best.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.860
Do it if you can.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:51.810
If you do, I'll take back what I said completely.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:52.920
On the other hand...

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:58.700
If you fail, I will be the one grouping with the Sweets Princes.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:02.590
Fine.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.830
Idiot! Don't decide on your own.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:05.580
That's right!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.240
But...

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.100
Hey!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.600
Enough of that, all of you.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.600
You are bothering the other guests, aren't you?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.460
Tennouji-san.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.460
President Tennouji.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.540
I'm very sorry.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:23.950
President, please admit our pudding confrontation.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.700
What foolishness are you speaking.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.230
It's interesting, isn't it?

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:32.990
How about agreeing to it, Tennouji-kun?

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:33.790
Chairman.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.110
Chairman?

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.980
We encourage those with determination.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.340
I'll be the judge for it.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.550
Understood.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:49.670
Then, you'll be making the basic custard pudding.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:52.060
You'll be selecting your own ingredients.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:56.060
It will be on... that's right. A challenge in 3 days time.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:00.900
3 days? Will I be all right?

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:00.900
The high school standards are very high.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:05.410
Humph! Do you really think you'll catch up to me in just 3 days?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.270
It's natural that you'll lose.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.270
No, I can't lose.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:14.860
Just watch, I'll definitely make a pudding more delicious than yours.

