Pointers for ways of cooking the batter.

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:19.750
Add a handful of sugar into a pot of milk.

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:23.170
Add in vanilla essence and turn on the heat.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:25.710
Here's a pointer:

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.510
Watch out to prevent it from boiling, so warm it slowly!

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:32.760
Remove the milk from the heat and add into the eggs.

00:23:32.770 --> 00:23:37.970
To remove all the air bubbles, use a paper napkin.

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:40.770
The bubbles on the batter can be cleanly removed with paper napkin.

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:45.520
Add warm water in the tray.

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:48.860
Finally, put it in the oven and you're done!

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:54.360
